{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "462dddb3e1cd2e903c953e00767450300944e05b58f3c472f244f97a9bb28c83", "ja": "二人だけの約束", "zh": "两人的约定", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b7f2a8a9364294b674cb371859ce42635df42c6660e613876b0b4d900567e7fd", "ja": "高校時代の撮影が終了し、安心する二人。\n風花は今度こそと、アフタヌーン女子会に\n貴音を誘うが、頑なに行きたがらない。\n自身の事情に風花を巻き込みたくない貴音の\n思いに気づき風花は二人で会う約束をする。", "zh": "高中时代的拍摄结束后，两人都松了口气。\n风花想着这次一定要成功，邀请琴叶参加午后的女子聚会，\n可琴叶却怎么也不肯去。\n风花察觉到琴叶不想让自己卷入她的事情，\n于是约定下次只和琴叶两个人见面。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1000_staff", "source_sha256": "077de8f169ab702ad16792f8039d30b4d60a046b3ebb391012cae5332c17ef4c", "ja": "はい。それでは、本日の撮影は終了となります。\nお疲れさまでした！", "zh": "好的。那么，今天的拍摄就到此结束。\n辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1001_staff", "source_sha256": "de76005c36934bcbcaa07592dce6295bf6c39baccd147d50337640fa7c4bf262", "ja": "お疲れさまでしたー！", "zh": "大家辛苦了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2926e3966fa23ef81ebd36654c47dc6b05a033b78232fd56b612d45acee2b0f0", "ja": "ふぅ……やっと制服が脱げて、ほっとしちゃった♪\nこれで高校時代編はオールアップだね！", "zh": "呼……终于能脱下制服了，真是松了口气♪\n这样高中时代篇就全部杀青了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1003_008tak", "source_sha256": "12da66ae5001357c5501da78ba173d733e3fda756b8e56cfab97e2165656f9bd", "ja": "風花はずっと制服のことを気にしていましたね。\nいささか不思議なほどでした。", "zh": "风花一直都很在意制服呢。真是有些不可思议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1004_008tak", "source_sha256": "c73093ced7a024a9771db36ec80ebd3fc01e162fec6cd6f813ca365e43544f86", "ja": "どこから見ても、まさに高校生の帆風、と\n桜木監督にもお墨付きをいただきましたのに。", "zh": "明明连樱木导演都认可了，说无论从哪里看，帆风都完全是一名高中生呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "45c331a8d2b21619d34da6c1dbd7a9e34b1e23c090971f20998f45bd01f19548", "ja": "ううん、貴音ちゃんの制服姿こそ素敵だったよ！\n夕貴乃の魅力をぐっと引き立たせていたと思うなぁ。", "zh": "没有啦，贵音穿制服的样子才叫迷人呢！\n我觉得把夕贵乃的魅力衬托得非常出彩哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1006_008tak", "source_sha256": "0fb725afb9154919d89f0914588536ddb37ff128233b0742779d77ba89d34682", "ja": "だとすれば、それも風花の助言のおかげかと。\n真、学生生活は賑やかで楽しいものなのですね。", "zh": "这样的话，也多亏了风花的建议。\n真，学生生活原来是如此热闹而快乐的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "fa00165b90bb76b00cc99a0dd530691783bbf5deac4a600a44ce6c4b28d8c128", "ja": "ふふっ、そうだね。女の子ばっかりだと特に……\nあ、そうそう！　さっき聞いたんだけど……。", "zh": "呵呵，说得也是。要是全都是女孩子的话，尤其是……\n啊，对了对了！我刚才听说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "70ab183fd95dd3f86942b805f5b53ccac850cb25aea621c88adf03fea8c2a165", "ja": "今度出演者の女の子たちで、女子会っていうか、\nアフヌン会をやることになったの。", "zh": "下次女出演者们要办个女子聚会，或者说是下午茶聚会吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8c15db7711409ddaaa9fdcf143ae1c7eba469ed95c3573e535fc86ef82d5d295", "ja": "アフヌンならお酒もないし、貴音ちゃんも参加しやすい\nと思うんだけど……よかったら、一緒に行ってみない？", "zh": "下午茶聚会的话，既没有酒，贵音也比较方便参加……你愿意的话，要不要一起去？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "9731c98d3916da2ea89d940d49946a872e2fa655e06143a67bc5ce86b2452fc7", "ja": "あふぬん……？", "zh": "下午茶……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "705901c91dfd59a71f05c4c5ad9f71f617603825394228af3678c527e1b9c99b", "ja": "あ、アフタヌーンティーの会。紅茶を飲みながら、\nケーキやお菓子と一緒に、おしゃべりを楽しむの。", "zh": "啊，是下午茶会。边喝红茶，边享用蛋糕和点心，聊聊天。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5e8b47e64ef065228a0ccf1fc8ba2fc2158e05a351e8c7606439330eb8d30530", "ja": "三段ぐらいのお皿に、ケーキとかサンドイッチが可愛く\n盛り付けられていて。素敵でしょ？", "zh": "蛋糕和三明治之类的点心，可爱地摆放在大约三层的盘子上。很棒吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1013_008tak", "source_sha256": "f76e57dd6e89708175ec64dbe6759c65d2dca9a0fa7c82e291916474fa17efc8", "ja": "まぁ。なんとも優雅なお茶会なのですね。", "zh": "哎呀。真是无比优雅的茶会呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "327af55ee76e72fd3af5caac4f9716d1b54cd33f39eb382fe3817a00b3429b95", "ja": "そうなの！　それに今回は女の子だけだから、\nお話しもしやすいと思うよ。……ね、どうかな？", "zh": "没错！而且这次只有女孩子，应该也更方便聊天。……你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "d833a95cc24239e3106e5f6bf5850458cd7912e00b058fd43b0c66293fe01ccf", "ja": "ありがとうございます。\nひとつだけ、お伺いしたいのですが。", "zh": "谢谢您。\n只是有一件事，我想向您请教一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1016_008tak", "source_sha256": "11b9a9b7c366bf9c89ff489204c5dfb03840a52166f02c3e6810afdbfd0140d5", "ja": "その会は、風花が企画してくれたのではありませんか？\nおそらく……私のために。", "zh": "那场聚会，是风花为我策划的吧？\n恐怕……是为了我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "63b0a53cd81edf40031293fd128ba9d36729c27e83d913a1c83bcbf1dcfcab8a", "ja": "えっ……。", "zh": "咦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "639d9e176bb5d16eb1f853bbda594baba6c43c1639ed9ffcb182052cdf7edf4c", "ja": "ど、どうかな？　これは私が行きたかっただけで、\nそんなに深い意味はないんだけど……あれ？", "zh": "怎、怎么样？只是我自己想去而已，并没有什么特别的含义……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1019_008tak", "source_sha256": "e7cec806ff39bf256024dbaa05f854e38caebbc92ef2f8cc8a70c5028739c05b", "ja": "やはり、気を遣わせてしまったようですね。\n……申し訳ありません。", "zh": "看来，还是让您费心了呢。\n……实在抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9291373868451d44e5a5e8a25aebc25649e18ad7dc1a67307308413fa5f5dfa9", "ja": "う……。ち、違うよ、貴音ちゃん。\nアフヌン会はね、本当に私が行きたかっただけ！", "zh": "呜……不、不是的，贵音。下午茶会真的只是我自己想去而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1021_041fuk", "source_sha256": "348a77bb0caa8d92d36c860d49fa1fb46fdf2fe286c2575e6a1ae22ffc7a887f", "ja": "ただ貴音ちゃんと、\nみんなと一緒に、だけど……。", "zh": "只是想和贵音还有大家一起去，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1023_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4a55f633fa518607af368b080c5087778d5b596e261c0d35d5ad1831fb1943fa", "ja": "だから気を遣って、とかじゃ全然ないの。\n……でも、やっぱり迷惑だった？", "zh": "所以完全不是因为顾虑到大家什么的。\n……不过，果然还是给你添麻烦了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1024_008tak", "source_sha256": "001db80b14bab4c514644025fe977a46d4af00d5f6407c7d15f918c631137507", "ja": "いえ、ありがたいと思っています。\nですが……私は、行かないほうがよいかと。", "zh": "不，我觉得您这么做很贴心。\n但是……我是不是还是不去比较好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1025_041fuk", "source_sha256": "189ac879514e7616dabab1bba5ebca241ba79e1ea8e86f8e2731d335bd0a21d5", "ja": "そっか……残念。\n……どうしてか、聞いてもいい？", "zh": "这样啊……真遗憾。\n……可以问问你为什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1026_008tak", "source_sha256": "5c108e97c6632236aa1984b3d600ee4d907ea9b7870703422159d14d56461913", "ja": "はい。そのように人の集まる場では、私こそ……\n浮いてしまいますので。", "zh": "是的。在这种人群聚集的场合，我反而会显得格格不入……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1027_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a4bed497a8029dd702d6f2d573d35187686b3f52c12cabc42e979a86a7faaab8", "ja": "浮いて……？　たしかに貴音ちゃんは目立つけど、\n浮くってわけじゃ……？", "zh": "显眼……？贵音确实很引人注目，但也不能说是格格不入吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1028_008tak", "source_sha256": "69bc012ec157aa3a8b7512922565a124d1aed320525dc42ac074b49a0637f7cc", "ja": "私はやはり異郷の者……。\nそうであることを厭うたことはありません。", "zh": "我果然是异乡之人……我从未厌恶过这一点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1029_008tak", "source_sha256": "931fded17062821b35ab0339207834dfd37ebe982543ccf4f6d8cbfb966beef2", "ja": "ただ、そんな私の宿命に、仲間を……\n風花、貴女を巻き込みたくはないのです。決して。", "zh": "只是，我不想让同伴……风花，不想让你卷入我这样的宿命。绝对不想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1031_041fuk", "source_sha256": "1cdc6a3ace84b1a3b590cb2e9489601ce88bdb79ed0d2eb3d390f54fe79854de", "ja": "わかりました。もちろん、無理に連れて行こう、\nなんて思ってないから、気にしないでね。", "zh": "明白了。当然，我也没想过要勉强你一起去，所以别在意啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1032_041fuk", "source_sha256": "031f05782453217db33a628619a25ab23d55939c731c9423d2cf6e9eb58896f2", "ja": "その代わり、二人でご飯でも食べにいこっか。\nそれならいいでしょ？", "zh": "那就改成我们两个人一起去吃个饭吧。这样总可以了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0446_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0446_story_04_1033_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6b137d4af395b2cb41d21792f5560eac8530b18d68235e76a1267820e0cf1b87", "ja": "だって、私達はもう仲間だから。\n……ね♪", "zh": "因为我们已经是伙伴了嘛。\n……对吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
